T-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">구분</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.6pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"41\" valign=\"center\" width=\"123\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">이수 횟수</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.6pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"41\" valign=\"center\" width=\"147\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">기간</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.6pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"41\" valign=\"center\" width=\"92\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">이수</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">학점</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.6pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.6pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.6pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.6pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"42\" valign=\"center\" width=\"202\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">학기제 현장실습</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.6pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.6pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.6pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.6pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"42\" valign=\"center\" width=\"123\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">재학중 1회</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.6pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.6pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.6pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.6pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"42\" valign=\"center\" width=\"147\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">15주 이상</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.6pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.6pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.6pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.6pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"42\" valign=\"center\" width=\"92\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">12</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.6pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.6pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.6pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.6pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"39\" valign=\"center\" width=\"202\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">취업연계 현장실습 1</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.6pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.6pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.6pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.6pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"156\" valign=\"center\" rowspan=\"4\" width=\"123\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\">재학중 1회</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.6pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.6pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.6pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.6pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"39\" valign=\"center